{
    "title": "Find Lover",
    "description": "Find Your Date\r\n\r\nIsn't it time to find the love you're looking for? Download our app and create your account now, and it's completely free.\r\n\r\nOur app is designed to bring single people together. If you're tired of seeing happy couples every time you leave your home and wondering why you don't have a partner, you can start chatting with single people around you without going too far from your safe zone. Who knows, at the end of this conversation you might even be able to arrange a date for a coffee.\r\n\r\nWhether you are looking for a serious relationship, marriage or just someone to chat with for a while, our matching system will list the most suitable candidates for you and thanks to our completely free chat system, you will probably find the right person after a few conversations.\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for a boyfriend or girlfriend, our app will find singles in your city and bring you together in a real messaging environment if there is a mutual interest. Moreover, you can filter candidates according to your city, hobbies and expectations and make more accurate choices.\r\n\r\nEven if your goal is just to expand your social circle, you can meet many new people just by chatting. Maybe this is how a true friendship can start. You will surely find a friend for you among our millions of members. Enrich your profile to meet and chat with someone right away and highlight the features that reflect you more.\r\n\r\nTo find a girlfriend or boyfriend, you must first send your request to the other party and use your profile fields to introduce yourself, then wait for the candidates you send a request to evaluate and like you. If there is a male match, we will notify you immediately.\r\n\r\nOur app is completely free, and we will not charge you for any features.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Find Your Date<br><br>Isn&#39;t it time to find the love you&#39;re looking for? Download our app and create your account now, and it&#39;s completely free.<br><br>Our app is designed to bring single people together. If you&#39;re tired of seeing happy couples every time you leave your home and wondering why you don&#39;t have a partner, you can start chatting with single people around you without going too far from your safe zone. Who knows, at the end of this conversation you might even be able to arrange a date for a coffee.<br><br>Whether you are looking for a serious relationship, marriage or just someone to chat with for a while, our matching system will list the most suitable candidates for you and thanks to our completely free chat system, you will probably find the right person after a few conversations.<br><br>Whether you&#39;re looking for a boyfriend or girlfriend, our app will find singles in your city and bring you together in a real messaging environment if there is a mutual interest. Moreover, you can filter candidates according to your city, hobbies and expectations and make more accurate choices.<br><br>Even if your goal is just to expand your social circle, you can meet many new people just by chatting. Maybe this is how a true friendship can start. You will surely find a friend for you among our millions of members. Enrich your profile to meet and chat with someone right away and highlight the features that reflect you more.<br><br>To find a girlfriend or boyfriend, you must first send your request to the other party and use your profile fields to introduce yourself, then wait for the candidates you send a request to evaluate and like you. If there is a male match, we will notify you immediately.<br><br>Our app is completely free, and we will not charge you for any features.",
